          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "संशोधन — saṁśodhan — \"research\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ती पाण्याच्या प्रदूषणावर संशोधन करते. tī pāṇyācyā pradūṣṇāvar saṁśodhan karte. She does research on water pollution."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Neuter."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "संशोधन (saṁśodhan) करणे, to do research; the researcher is संशोधक."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "संशोधन (saṁśodhan) is a tatsama, taken from Sanskrit saṁśodhana, \"purifying; correcting\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
